# Batches

The configurations of the yunos of {{project}}, one directory per node:

```text
yunos/batches/<host>/<yuno>.json
```

`yunetas sync-configs` matches each directory with the realms of the agent
it connects to (or takes one with `--host <host>`) and installs every
configuration in it. Each file carries its `__version__` and a one-line
`__description__` of what that version changes; bump both on every edit.

The data a yuno needs from its first start goes here too, as configuration,
not in the code.
